WEBVTT

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:31.143
Which means that by doing it once,

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:35.226
we can close the gender
and literacy gap forever.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.684
I work in India,

00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:39.559
which has made incredible progress

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:42.809
in bringing elementary education for all.

00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:46.851
However, we still have
four million out-of-school girls,

00:01:46.875 --> 00:01:48.750
one of the highest in the world.

00:01:49.917 --> 00:01:53.601
And girls are out of school
because of, obviously poverty,

00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:55.893
social, cultural factors.

00:01:55.917 --> 00:01:59.042
But there's also this
underlying factor of mindset.